      "encoding": "utf8",
      "content": "# Cloudflare-Pages security-header suite for color.babb.dev — U.W-SEC / U-F39.\n#\n# The Pages build root copies `public/` verbatim, so this file is the honored\n# locus for response headers on the demo origin. It brings color.babb.dev to\n# parity with the api origin's already-complete suite (api/apache-vhost.conf\n# :52-59) — CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy.\n#\n# The CSP is DERIVED from the demo's real resource graph, NOT copied from the\n# api's `default-src 'none'` (which is correct for a JSON endpoint but would\n# blank the app). Each directive traces to a live need:\n#\n#   default-src 'self'         the fallback floor — bundled JS/CSS is same-origin.\n#   script-src  'self'         + 'unsafe-inline' for the index.html boot IIFE (the\n#                              fouc-guard / ground-paint classic <script>, kept in\n#                              lockstep with boot/ground.ts) — Vite leaves classic\n#                              inline scripts in the built HTML. No 'unsafe-eval':\n#                              Vue SFCs are precompiled at build; WebGL shader\n#                              compilation is not eval.\n#   style-src   'self'         + 'unsafe-inline' for the index.html <style> blocks\n#                              (@font-face / @property / fouc-guard) and the inline\n#                              styles Vue :style bindings, reka-ui, and KaTeX inject.\n#   img-src     'self'         + data: / blob: (canvas + uploaded-image previews,\n#                              lib/palette/export.ts object URLs) +\n#                              https://avatars.githubusercontent.com (the GitHub\n#                              avatar in dock/menus/ProfileSection.vue).\n#   font-src    'self'         Fraunces (public/fonts/*.woff2) AND the KaTeX faces\n#                              (bundled via katex.min.css) are both self-hosted;\n#                              the Google-Fonts actor was retired (T.W2 · LS-6).\n#   connect-src 'self'         + https://api.color.babb.dev — the palette API fetch\n#                              target (lib/palette/api/client.ts:36-37, the resolved\n#                              cross-origin BASE_URL).\n#   object-src 'none' · base-uri 'self' · form-action 'self' · frame-ancestors\n#   'none' · upgrade-insecure-requests   standing hardening; frame-ancestors 'none'\n#                              is the CSP-level twin of X-Frame-Options: DENY.\n#\n# The transport/policy headers mirror the api referent verbatim (HSTS max-age,\n# X-Frame-Options DENY, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, X-XSS-Protection 0).\n#\n# The LIVE on-wire confirmation (a GET to color.babb.dev showing these headers)\n# is deploy-dependent — owner-attested at deploy, BOOKED to U.W-CLOSE / U-F61.\n\n/*\n  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://avatars.githubusercontent.com; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self' https://api.color.babb.dev; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests\n  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains\n  X-Frame-Options: DENY\n  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff\n  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin\n  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()\n  X-XSS-Protection: 0\n",
