etrics to each browser's math engine — WebKit's\n            // MathML-Core is the least mature, an S-22 (Safari-truth) risk.\n            output: \"htmlAndMathml\",\n        });\n    }\n};\n\nonMounted(renderKatex);\n\nwatch(() => expression, renderKatex);\n</script>\n",
