      "content": "/*\n * ── The house code-plate ink (S.W4-8 · design-gradient P1-8 · design-docs-about P2-2) ──\n *\n * ONE hljs token theme for every code surface — the docs pages' build-time\n * TypeScript plates (plugins/vite-source-export.ts emits\n * `<pre class=\"hljs typescript\">`) and the gradient pane's live CSS editor\n * (GradientCodeEditor.vue). It replaces the wholesale GitHub css imports\n * (a white paper card in light, a #0d1117 navy plate in dark — foreign\n * surface, foreign brand palette) and kills the per-component-family\n * <style> head-injection swap: dark rides `.dark` like every other token,\n * no JS theme store, no runtime css string.\n *\n * Register: INK ONLY. The theme paints no background — the surface belongs\n * to the plate (Markdown.vue's `pre`, the editor's glass wash), never to\n * the grammar. Crayon primaries PROPORTIONED: the body of the code stays\n * ink; the crayons land only where grammar earns them (keywords red,\n * entities blue, strings green, numbers ochre); comments recede to the\n * muted voice. The mono voice is Fira (`--font-stack-mono`, the\n * three-voice law).\n *\n * AB-3/AB-4 (T.W8 remediation_1) — THE WELL RE-GUARD. The markdown code chip\n * ground moved from `--muted` to the rung-2 well (`--well-bg` = card 92% +\n * fg 8%), a DARKER tone-step: the light chip ground dropped rgb(246 243 239)\n * → rgb(233 225 217). Re-censused live (dpr2, owner color lab(38% 32 24)) on\n * the landed well ground, THREE light tokens fell under the 4.5 floor —\n * comment 4.19, string 4.20, number 3.82 — where only `number` failed on the\n * old muted ground. All three are re-seated below (the crayon HUE/chroma\n * hold; only L drops one step). The comment leaves `--muted-foreground` —\n * that token is guarded for the lighter page/muted ground, not the well — for\n * an explicit warm-gray guarded for the well in BOTH schemes (dark comment\n * was 4.49 on the dark well; lifted). Dark string/number/keyword/entity clear\n * on the dark well unchanged. Post-fix on the well: comment 5.33/5.04, string\n * 4.99, number 4.91, keyword 4.91, entity/title 5.41 (light) — all ≥4.5.\n */\n\n:root {\n    --code-ink: var(--foreground);\n    /* The four crayons + the muted comment, guarded for the light WELL field\n     * (the rung-2 code-chip ground, AB-3). */\n    --code-comment: hsl(30 22% 34%); /* warm muted gray (well-guarded) */\n    --code-keyword: oklch(0.51 0.19 27); /* crayon red   */\n    --code-entity: oklch(0.47 0.14 262); /* crayon blue  */\n    --code-string: oklch(0.47 0.13 145); /* crayon green (AB-4 well re-guard) */\n    --code-number: oklch(0.49 0.12 78); /* crayon ochre (AB-4 well re-guard) */\n}\n\n.dark {\n    /* The same set, lifted for the dark chocolate WELL field. */\n    --code-comment: hsl(34 14% 66%); /* warm muted gray (well-guarded) */\n    --code-keyword: oklch(0.75 0.15 27);\n    --code-entity: oklch(0.76 0.11 262);\n    --code-string: oklch(0.77 0.11 148);\n    --code-number: oklch(0.8 0.11 85);\n}\n\n.hljs {\n    color: var(--code-ink);\n    background: transparent;\n    font-family: var(--font-stack-mono);\n}\n\n.hljs-comment,\n.hljs-quote {\n    color: var(--code-comment);\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n\n.hljs-keyword,\n.hljs-selector-tag,\n.hljs-doctag,\n.hljs-meta {\n    color: var(--code-keyword);\n}\n\n.hljs-title,\n.hljs-title.class_,\n.hljs-title.function_,\n.hljs-built_in,\n.hljs-type,\n.hljs-selector-class,\n.hljs-selector-id,\n.hljs-selector-pseudo,\n.hljs-attribute {\n    color: var(--code-entity);\n}\n\n.hljs-string,\n.hljs-regexp,\n.hljs-addition {\n    color: var(--code-string);\n}\n\n.hljs-number,\n.hljs-literal,\n.hljs-symbol {\n    color: var(--code-number);\n}\n\n/* The proportion clause: attrs, params, variables, operators, punctuation\n * all stay ink — the crayons are accents, never a rainbow. */\n.hljs-attr,\n.hljs-params,\n.hljs-property,\n.hljs-variable,\n.hljs-template-variable,\n.hljs-operator,\n.hljs-punctuation,\n.hljs-subst {\n    color: var(--code-ink);\n}\n\n.hljs-emphasis {\n    font-style: italic;\n}\n\n.hljs-strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n}\n",
      "live": {
        "absent": false,
        "bytes": 4011,
