        "content": "/**\n * ImageEyedropper/constants — visual constants for the eyedropper loupe.\n *\n * Extracted from `ImageEyedropper.vue` at D.W3 Lane A (De §2.4 split).\n */\n\n/** Loupe diameter in CSS px. */\nexport const LOUPE_SIZE = 110;\n\n/** Number of source pixels sampled along each loupe diameter. */\nexport const LOUPE_PIXELS = 11;\n"
