        "content": "// Solution/aggregator (K.W2 — inv-K-1 structural split).\n//\n// The unified `include: [\"src/\", \"demo/\"]` was split into two programs so the\n// PUBLISHED library graph (tsconfig.lib.json, `src/` only) is glass-ui-free by\n// construction, while the demo graph (tsconfig.demo.json, `demo/`) resolves\n// glass-ui from source. This root only references the two leaves for editor /\n// `--build` ergonomics; the binding gates run each leaf with `-p … --noEmit`\n// (see the `typecheck` script). No `compilerOptions`/`include` live here — they\n// moved to tsconfig.base.json + the two leaves.\n{\n    \"files\": [],\n    \"references\": [\n        { \"path\": \"./tsconfig.lib.json\" },\n        { \"path\": \"./tsconfig.demo.json\" }\n    ]\n}\n"
